            </note>
            <note corresp="#d899-f2" n="2" xml:id="d899-f2-content">
                <p>In his response of Sept. 2, Kyes
                    confirmed that the Secretary of Defense had agreed to the Department of State
                    position on this question. (711.56352/9–253)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
